1
00:00:43,209 --> 00:00:46,533
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:49,536
=Episode 12=

3
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,560
Xiaotang?

4
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,720
Xiaotang, please spare me.
I know I was wrong.

5
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:04,360
For the sake of our years of friendship,

6
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:05,360
please spare me.

7
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:07,560
I really know I was wrong.

8
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,560
You were wrong?

9
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:10,560
Xia Na,

10
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:11,800
from the moment

11
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,680
you climbed into Lu Qingyuan's bed,

12
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:15,760
and then killed me with your own hands,

13
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:18,480
your mistake can't be erased
by "I was wrong".

14
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:21,160
What are you talking about?
I don't understand.

15
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:22,160
Just let me go, okay?

16
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:23,720
You know very well

17
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:24,720
what you did to me.

18
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:27,040
I don't know if I'll get a happy ending,

19
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:28,960
but the only thing I do know is

20
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,440
you don't deserve one.

21
00:01:41,720 --> 00:01:44,280
I-I know everything about Lu Qingyuan.

22
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,280
I can help you.

23
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:47,240
He abuses his authority.

24
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:49,080
He stole company ledgers.

25
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:51,040
He keeps tons of illegal books.

26
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,320
I can help you bring him down.

27
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,320
I can do anything. Just don't kill me.

28
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:55,960
Don't kill me, I beg you.

29
00:02:00,897 --> 00:02:04,800
(Inpatient Ward)

30
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:05,800
Mr. Lu,

31
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:07,120
your mother has signed the will.

32
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:10,440
Good.

33
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:12,720
Per protocol, as her next of kin,

34
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:15,760
you also need to sign
this surgical consent form.

35
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:17,040
- Then we can begin...
- Give it here.

36
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:23,040
Hurry up.

37
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:25,680
Mr. Lu, please wait
in the VIP lounge for now.

38
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,760
- The surgery will be over soon.
- Great. Hurry up.

39
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:47,120
(Everything in the Lu family
is finally mine.)

40
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,320
Mr. Lu, thank you for waiting.

41
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,360
Please have some water.

42
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:56,480
Thanks.

43
00:03:18,991 --> 00:03:20,293
(In operation)

44
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,760
Mrs. Lu, you're awake.

45
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:41,240
The surgery went very well.

46
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:43,000
The new kidney is already functioning.

47
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,400
Good.

48
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,240
Wonderful.

49
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:48,280
Now that I have a new kidney,

50
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,000
my whole body feels so light.

51
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:53,120
If you ask me,

52
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:55,880
Xia Na might be useless otherwise,

53
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:59,640
but her health is pretty solid.

54
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:01,440
You look great now.

55
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:04,200
The donor kidney
seems to be a perfect match.

56
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:07,040
Thank you all
for your hard work, Doctor.

57
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:10,360
My son is truly capable,

58
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:12,760
finding me such a perfect match.

59
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,800
Though Gu Xiaotang

60
00:04:16,280 --> 00:04:19,640
was totally useless when it counted.

61
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:23,560
If Qingyuan marries her,
that will be pure bad luck.

62
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:27,240
Mrs. Lu, you might still be
under the anesthesia.

63
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:30,280
The donor wasn't Xia Na.

64
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:32,480
N-Not Xia Na?

65
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,120
Then... then who was it?

66
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:42,160
It was your son, Lu Qingyuan.

67
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
Mr. Lu, you're awake.

68
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:52,200
How was the surgery?

69
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,680
Please don't get up yet.

70
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,040
Why am I here?

71
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:00,960
Where am I?

72
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:04,600
Mr. Lu, you're awake.

73
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,720
The surgery went well.

74
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,760
Please just rest.

75
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:09,720
What do you mean?

76
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:11,280
How's my mother?

77
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,720
What happened to me?

78
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,120
Mrs. Lu is recovering very well.

79
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:18,600
The incision on your waist
is from the kidney removal.

80
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:20,680
Please don't move around.

81
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,800
Or the stitches will tear.

82
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:22,800
What?

83
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:24,960
My kidney?

84
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:27,080
What are you saying?

85
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,800
Are you insane?

86
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:32,880
How dare you?

87
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:35,080
You set me up.

88
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:37,120
Do you want to die?

89
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,840
I suggest you stay still.

90
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:43,080
If that incision tears open,

91
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:45,440
you'll be the one suffering
when they restitch it.

92
00:05:45,880 --> 00:05:48,320
Gu Xiaotang, it's you.

93
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:50,400
You wretch!

94
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:52,320
What did you do to me?

95
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:55,920
Me? I just helped you be a good son.

96
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,960
I have no interest
in your life right now.

97
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:09,600
But the dirt you have
better be as good as you said.

98
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:13,800
Otherwise, this scalpel
won't just be cutting ropes.

99
00:06:18,102 --> 00:06:21,335
(Lu Qingyuan)

100
00:06:21,335 --> 00:06:25,295
(Surgical Consent Form)

101
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,160
It's in black and white,

102
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,160
legally binding.

103
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:31,360
You signed the consent form
yourself, didn't you?

104
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:34,360
You set me up.

105
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:35,760
Lu Qingyuan,

106
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:39,080
acting filial with someone else's life,

107
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,760
did you ever think

108
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:44,160
retribution would come this fast?

109
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:49,600
Nothing in this world
comes that easy, Lu Qingyuan.

110
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:52,080
Every dirty trick you used on me,

111
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:53,880
I'm paying back in full.

112
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:57,040
Gu Xiaotang, you wretch!

113
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:59,640
I'll haunt you from the grave!

114
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:01,520
I'll kill you all!

115
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,320
Get some good rest, Lu Qingyuan.

116
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,560
And think about our wedding tomorrow.

117
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:13,720
If you don't want to go broke
paying breach penalties,

118
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,240
you'd better show up on time.

119
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,040
Remember,

120
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:20,320
I expect you in top shape tomorrow.

121
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,920
Mr. Lu, please get some rest.

122
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:45,760
Xiaotang, this dress
looks amazing on you.

123
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:49,520
But you don't even care
about this wedding anymore.

124
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:51,880
- You...
- I'm wearing this to please myself.

125
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:53,200
When I wear it,

126
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:54,240
and who gets to see it,

127
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,440
are entirely up to me.

128
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,360
This is the one.

129
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:59,640
Although tomorrow is just a show,

130
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:00,800
I'll still please myself.

131
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,200
Mei.

132
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:05,400
Coming!

133
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:06,960
I'll get back to work.

134
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:52,760
How do I look?

135
00:08:53,160 --> 00:08:55,120
Beautiful. Just as I imagined.

136
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,120
Imagined what?

137
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:58,640
Ever since I saw
your wedding news online,

138
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:01,760
I've been imagining you
in a wedding dress.

139
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,640
You look even better than I imagined.

140
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,560
Put the veil on for me.

141
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:11,200
Me? Really?

142
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:12,840
Of course.

143
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:46,720
(Gu Xiaotang,)

144
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:50,000
(I'll get you out of the loop,
no matter what.)

145
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:53,160
Xiaotang,

146
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:58,520
you'll get the perfect life you deserve.

147
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,120
I think so too.

148
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,800
Here's your coffee.

149
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,480
Thank you.

150
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:15,720
Gu Xiaotang,

151
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:17,160
word has it

152
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:19,880
you won't wear
our sponsored wedding dress tomorrow.

153
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:21,800
We have a signed contract.

154
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:22,880
You can't just tear it up.

155
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:23,880
Tomorrow, you'll wear

156
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:25,040
that dress, whether you

157
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:26,080
like it or not.

158
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:30,560
- Or the penalty will bankrupt you.
- You...

159
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:31,800
Such a gorgeous dress.

160
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:35,720
To wear this dress,
I had two ribs removed.

161
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:39,320
It left a permanent scar
across my waist.

162
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:45,080
Every breath I take feels like
a knife slicing through me.

163
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:47,000
Sacrificing for art is your privilege.

164
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:49,360
Put it on now. Don't waste time.

165
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:51,280
You'd better play smart later...

166
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:52,280
Too bad, Mr. Wang.

167
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:56,440
My body is done sacrificing for art.

168
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,720
Let's go.

169
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:06,240
Gu Xiaotang, are you crazy?

170
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:07,240
Stop her!

171
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:09,800
My wedding dress.

172
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:10,800
My haute couture.

173
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:13,680
You're not leaving here
without compensating me.

174
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:14,680
Sue me if you want.

175
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:16,360
I can pay the damages.

176
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:21,360
But before we see a judge,

177
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,720
I'll release all the proof
of you and Director Li

178
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:26,160
using illegal contracts and threats

179
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:29,640
to force artists
into high-risk body modifications.

180
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:31,520
Tell me,

181
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:36,560
how many girls have you harmed
with these methods?

182
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,760
Once all this hits the headlines,

183
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:43,000
I wonder if your brand
will even survive until court day.

184
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,840
What bad luck. Let's go.

185
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:49,200
Okay. Move aside.

186
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:52,200
Where's Director Li?
Get him over here now!

187
00:11:52,400 --> 00:11:54,120
Make him clean up his own mess.

188
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:57,320
Mr. Wang, Director Li has been
out of contact for days.

189
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,320
We can't reach him.

190
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,320
What?

191
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,200
Director Li is missing?

192
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:10,240
Yeah, the brand team
can't reach him either.

193
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,640
I think he might be dead.

194
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:17,720
Give me the recording.

195
00:12:19,520 --> 00:12:20,680
(I know Director Li.)

196
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,760
(But I know Lu Qingyuan even better.)

197
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:26,640
(The moment Director Li
took that recording to Lu Qingyuan,)

198
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:28,840
(there was no way he'd come out alive.)

199
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:34,280
Tomorrow is the big show.

200
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:38,320
Are you ready to watch me
pass final judgment on Lu Qingyuan?

201
00:13:14,795 --> 00:13:18,151
♪The face deep in the heart♪

202
00:13:18,343 --> 00:13:20,805
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

203
00:13:22,180 --> 00:13:25,880
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

204
00:13:26,091 --> 00:13:28,531
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

205
00:13:28,678 --> 00:13:31,050
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

206
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:33,957
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

207
00:13:33,957 --> 00:13:36,278
♪Even for just a second♪

208
00:13:37,623 --> 00:13:41,086
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

209
00:13:41,214 --> 00:13:43,063
♪And sunlight reverses♪

210
00:13:43,063 --> 00:13:46,533
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

211
00:13:46,889 --> 00:13:48,963
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

212
00:13:49,465 --> 00:13:52,874
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

213
00:13:53,131 --> 00:13:58,343
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

214
00:13:59,597 --> 00:14:02,162
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

215
00:14:02,204 --> 00:14:05,657
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

216
00:14:06,234 --> 00:14:09,197
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

217
00:14:09,942 --> 00:14:12,550
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

218
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:16,173
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

219
00:14:16,643 --> 00:14:20,699
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
